# Styles shared by the complete examples, the same as those of templates/examples: the base typography, so that a new
# document of this folder converts before it has styles of its own. Each example brings its own look in its
# <name>.styles.stxt, which wins over these rules where they say the same thing.
Styles (dev.stxt.pdf):
	For element: Document
		Typography:
			Font: IBM Plex Sans
			Size: 10
			Line height: 14
			Color: #1E2328
